<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits ambushed military-escorted traders in Zamfara, killing dozens and also killing eight security operatives and 12 traders in a separate attack. ISWAP fighters launched an assault on a town in Borno but were repelled, with over 40 militants killed in air strikes. Kidnappers in Kaduna abducted a couple and their infant, demanding a N300 million ransom and releasing a video of the family. Atiku Abubakar called on security agencies to rescue the abducted family. The conflict caused 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQWHBBZ0hEb09RMFBJWmRQWWdLTWF2UHpNakVmZlhVaXVGRDBHcVpOY3RxcUE0VGRrc3VOQmJqVUp6MlpqNnZMOWlXMEpLX0tIY05mM2o4QVFoMDhOVzl4N3BaOElyRXg4U3dtN3lydllyLUNmYzlyUXRoZ1ljVHgxYnp1dmRPWThPQmx3Z0N1d3BQZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQbG1TWG9Ga05NWWRKcEF0M0JoOEd2Tk5ic3VIZ1ZBLU1jQ2FTWlpsZFRrTVRpX2RHVG1fc09QYU5ZNGVmbmc0MFpibFU1TmtOX0IyWG9uN1BUUGdiclFCVFFNd3ZLT1RyUERsT1JaeTVwYmVuVWlHQm5YWDV4NXNpZEh1OHgxeWtFQXl1Y2xuOEJSTHlvOEFDN0JOTC13S0IxUHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;crimefightersng.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPUlRULW9IdEhRbWU0TlktemJsbl9SSXFhTUxLY19CWVV4WnFwU01fRFFBVURNYzRJNWwzbVFPTW9sRHVQQ0w2dnVnYzRJRE1LV0YtMnZZenpxaFU2S2lLemVsNm1nRUw5dEZSLV8yOHcwcW5Xd25sa0R2RDFyWTV4ZVRCYTlicElET3N5bl9UanYxVjdoYjltRDZReExTem5VdjVVdHh2YTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOTERkZkxuWFhiSF9Bd2NLMUlrWnQtT3o5VmxfbTdvNzRyWjJFY3BLcFNmLWVqTFV6d2NJcVRwZDNxa2F0YjRRVV92Z2g3NGpHaFFuMXFleWhFQVBPem1yZzgybl9Ebzhldkw2TzJhU1hNZlJtZWF3enZhTkpQbm5zRG1oaHhPRzNENmxtcWJjNE9yYmEtVklv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Intel Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar